WEBVTT

00:00.980 --> 00:02.980
Priestesses of the Godless Month

00:00.980 --> 00:02.980
Kannazuki no Miko

00:06.940 --> 00:08.149
Dad!

00:08.150 --> 00:09.569
Mom!

00:09.570 --> 00:12.239
Look, it's a pretty shell.

00:12.240 --> 00:13.240
See?

00:13.241 --> 00:15.979
Yes, it really is pretty.

00:15.980 --> 00:19.409
All right, Dad will make you a pendant.

00:19.410 --> 00:20.659
Really?

00:20.660 --> 00:23.880
Then I'll make it my treasure.

00:48.850 --> 00:52.920
Haruka ni sotto yurameku urei
kattou no kioku ni ugokasare

00:52.921 --> 00:56.989
Moving the slowly unfolding, distressing
troubles from afar that were in the past

00:56.990 --> 01:00.055
mabuta ni zutto haritsuku
shiroi zekkyou ni kogoeta

01:00.056 --> 01:03.119
Strongly closing the eyelids,
the white screams have frozen

01:03.120 --> 01:05.240
- shizumu tsuki no mayoi
- The confusion of the setting moon

01:05.860 --> 01:07.640
Sonzai wa tashikani Ima koko ni

01:07.641 --> 01:09.419
Surely my existence is here now

01:09.420 --> 01:11.130
- matte iru no wa
- Waiting for me

01:11.133 --> 01:12.465
Namida nado mou nagasanai

01:12.466 --> 01:13.799
There's no more tears to cry

01:13.800 --> 01:15.925
tada dakiaeru shunkan

01:15.926 --> 01:18.050
When the moment comes when
we embrace each other

01:18.500 --> 01:20.650
ienai kikenai mienai maboroshi dake

01:20.651 --> 01:22.800
Unspoken, unheard, unseen, just an illusion

01:23.020 --> 01:25.470
toki no mukou kawa e to nagasarete

01:25.471 --> 01:27.919
Flowing towards the other side of time,

01:27.920 --> 01:30.240
mayoigo ni naru yurusenu negai

01:30.241 --> 01:32.560
becoming like a lost
child, an unforgiven wish

01:32.860 --> 01:35.050
koe dake yubi dake chikazuku ondo dake

01:35.051 --> 01:37.239
Only voice, only fingers,
only the approaching warmth

01:37.240 --> 01:41.535
todokanu omoi ga chigirarete
yokaze o someru

01:41.536 --> 01:45.830
Unspoken thoughts get tainted
by the shredded night wind

01:55.810 --> 02:00.370
Since I didn't have shelter after
the Orochi wrecked the dorm...

02:00.720 --> 02:03.720
I decided to stay at
Chikane-chan's home.

02:04.800 --> 02:09.689
Later, I heard that Chikane-chan's
family, the Himemiya family...

02:09.690 --> 02:13.189
would bear all repair costs
for the damaged buildings...

02:13.190 --> 02:16.820
and medical costs for the
injured of the village.

02:17.730 --> 02:21.360
And then my new days...

02:23.970 --> 02:27.040
My days of fighting began from here.

02:29.040 --> 02:31.550
Third Episode

02:31.551 --> 02:34.060
Secret Love Shell

02:39.990 --> 02:42.100
Welcome home.

02:44.530 --> 02:47.020
Ojousama, the bath is ready.

02:48.130 --> 02:50.099
Kurusugawa-sama, for you too. Please.

02:50.100 --> 02:52.110
I'm no "-sama"...

02:56.970 --> 02:59.770
I've heard the details from Ojousama.

03:00.210 --> 03:03.339
Please consider this your home and relax.

03:03.340 --> 03:04.609
Um, uh...

03:04.610 --> 03:06.309
I-I'm in your debt.

03:06.310 --> 03:07.409
Kurusugawa-san.

03:07.410 --> 03:10.040
Right. P-Please excuse me.

03:11.120 --> 03:12.649
I see...

03:12.650 --> 03:13.920
Ojousama...

03:15.060 --> 03:16.620
That girl is...

03:21.720 --> 03:25.140
W-Why am I so nervous?

03:26.530 --> 03:31.409
Her skin's as white as snow, and
her breasts are big and beautiful.

03:31.410 --> 03:35.440
Even girls like me get
absorbed by her beauty.

03:36.780 --> 03:38.780
Am I weird?

03:39.850 --> 03:41.679
What is it, Himeko?

03:41.680 --> 03:44.700
No, uh, it's nothing.

03:48.820 --> 03:52.039
She's very good friends with Ojousama.

03:52.040 --> 03:55.540
Yes, they're like real siblings.

03:55.730 --> 03:58.050
You there, stop gossiping!

04:02.800 --> 04:03.800
Sorry...

04:04.410 --> 04:07.009
You'll have to bear with mine today.

04:07.010 --> 04:09.810
Not at all. It's no burden.

04:11.780 --> 04:13.719
Is something wrong?

04:13.720 --> 04:14.810
That's not it.

04:15.920 --> 04:18.820
It's just that I recognize
your scent on them.

04:22.560 --> 04:24.320
What? Was that weird?

04:24.860 --> 04:26.720
I'm sorry, but...

04:28.000 --> 04:29.690
I was too late.

04:31.730 --> 04:33.750
Are you sure you're fine here?

04:34.940 --> 04:36.670
There are bigger rooms.

04:37.780 --> 04:40.979
But if it's too big, I can't relax.

04:40.980 --> 04:44.079
I see. Well, you're tired today, right?

04:44.080 --> 04:45.300
Rest well.

04:46.880 --> 04:49.010
Good night, Chikane-chan.

04:51.650 --> 04:53.810
Good night, Himeko.

04:57.190 --> 05:00.690
I'll move into the room next to
Kurusugawa-san's by tomorrow.

05:03.100 --> 05:04.860
Please take care of that, Otoha-san.

05:05.430 --> 05:07.880
Yes, as you wish.

05:09.870 --> 05:11.370
I'm so tired...

05:11.840 --> 05:12.869
No, no.

05:12.870 --> 05:15.870
I need to work hard starting tomorrow.

05:16.180 --> 05:17.549
I'll be fine.

05:17.550 --> 05:19.840
Chikane-chan will be with me, after all.

05:20.780 --> 05:22.050
I'll be fine.

05:23.650 --> 05:24.819
Does it hurt?

05:24.820 --> 05:26.449
Ow, I said it hurts! Stop!

05:26.450 --> 05:27.890
Really?

05:28.120 --> 05:29.890
Ow!

05:30.890 --> 05:32.729
Okay, I'm done, meow.

05:32.730 --> 05:35.890
Couldn't you hear me say,
"Stop", you dumb shit?

05:36.110 --> 05:39.069
But I love giving shots!

05:39.070 --> 05:41.939
Then I'll give you one. Hand it over!

05:41.940 --> 05:43.610
No way, I hate getting shots.

05:44.400 --> 05:50.620
Don't fool around with me! Besides,
it's too big for you anyway!

05:45.470 --> 05:49.039
Well, it seems you've fully recovered.

05:49.040 --> 05:50.619
Your sister is happy.

05:50.620 --> 05:52.540
A-Aneki...

05:53.010 --> 05:54.870
Well, it's time for repentance.

05:55.520 --> 05:57.050
Come with me.

06:00.190 --> 06:04.029
Well, it's good medicine
for a dumb muscle-head.

06:04.030 --> 06:05.429
What next?

06:05.430 --> 06:08.090
Who's going to check up on things?

06:09.630 --> 06:11.970
Day after tomorrow is deadline.

06:11.971 --> 06:13.890
I see. Well, I pass, too.

06:14.160 --> 06:17.640
I have work and a yearly,
new song to debut.

06:17.970 --> 06:21.230
Nekoko will go! I'll play with Meow-Meow.

06:22.180 --> 06:23.650
M-Meow-Meow?

06:24.010 --> 06:26.010
Izuhara no Tamazuchi.

06:44.400 --> 06:45.630
Himeko.

06:48.140 --> 06:49.720
Chikane-chan...

06:50.270 --> 06:53.369
I had a very, very scary dream, and...

06:53.370 --> 06:56.279
I didn't know what was going on, and...

06:56.280 --> 06:58.309
I'm sorry I woke you up.

06:58.310 --> 07:00.149
That's all right.

07:00.150 --> 07:01.880
But get some rest now.

07:02.230 --> 07:04.110
I'll stay here for a while.

07:04.920 --> 07:06.150
Thank you.

07:20.200 --> 07:21.920
Good morning, Chikane-chan.

07:22.140 --> 07:24.420
Good morning, Kurusugawa-san.

07:28.920 --> 07:30.749
Good morning.

07:30.750 --> 07:33.430
This morning, it's a
Japanese breakfast set...

07:33.750 --> 07:35.770
with grilled salmon
and autumn mushrooms.

07:36.690 --> 07:38.619
Oh, Japanese-style today?

07:38.620 --> 07:42.300
Yes, we obtained very good
salmon and mushrooms.

07:43.320 --> 07:44.940
Shiitake...

07:45.150 --> 07:47.219
Kurusugawa-sama, what is it?

07:47.220 --> 07:50.029
U-Um, just thinking it looks great.

07:50.030 --> 07:51.030
Thanks for the food.

07:55.160 --> 07:55.238
Shiitake

08:00.010 --> 08:01.730
Have a nice day.

08:15.760 --> 08:16.760
Kurusugawa-san.

08:18.060 --> 08:20.290
Let's go, Kurusugawa-san.

08:24.500 --> 08:26.230
Look, it's Miya-sama!

08:26.450 --> 08:28.039
Good day, Miya-sama.

08:28.040 --> 08:29.230
Good day.

08:29.740 --> 08:33.239
Hey, who is that girl with Miya-sama?

08:33.240 --> 08:34.870
I don't know.

08:44.790 --> 08:49.090
Look, Miya-sama and the prince.
The school's greatest shot.

08:49.240 --> 08:51.810
So who's that girl?

08:53.090 --> 08:54.090
Oogami-kun...

08:55.730 --> 08:57.090
Are you all right?

08:58.100 --> 09:00.299
Since you protected me.

09:00.300 --> 09:02.230
I'll protect you from now on.

09:02.770 --> 09:05.600
I'll make sure to protect you.

09:28.630 --> 09:29.930
Mako-chan...

09:30.160 --> 09:32.800
Good morning, Kurusugawa-san.

09:33.130 --> 09:35.139
M-Morning, Izumi-san.

09:35.140 --> 09:40.609
Say, I heard rumors that you're
staying at Miya-sama's place.

09:40.610 --> 09:41.180
Is that true?

09:41.420 --> 09:44.140
That can't be true, right?

09:44.330 --> 09:47.449
Many students lived in that dorm...

09:47.450 --> 09:50.279
and you getting special attention is...

09:50.280 --> 09:52.789
I'd understand if she's a maid.

09:52.790 --> 09:54.099
It can't be.

09:54.100 --> 09:56.180
So is it true or not?

09:57.360 --> 09:59.389
Oh, too bad.

09:59.390 --> 10:01.320
We'll discuss this later.

10:16.510 --> 10:20.079
Look, that's the girl staying
at Miya-sama's place.

10:20.080 --> 10:21.679
I heard that, too.

10:21.680 --> 10:23.249
Why her?

10:23.250 --> 10:26.189
Miya-sama is especially kind.

10:26.190 --> 10:27.989
But still...

10:27.990 --> 10:29.690
She's like a dog.

10:35.360 --> 10:36.990
Who was it? Who did that?

10:37.330 --> 10:39.199
You coward, come out!

10:39.200 --> 10:40.490
O-Oogami-kun...

10:41.500 --> 10:45.109
I-I'm okay. Thank you.

10:45.110 --> 10:46.639
But, Kurusugawa...

10:46.640 --> 10:48.239
Please, okay?

10:48.240 --> 10:50.239
Okay, I understand.

10:50.240 --> 10:51.240
She's lucky.

10:51.520 --> 10:54.040
Oh, well. Things have just started.

11:01.420 --> 11:03.049
M-Miya-sama!

11:03.050 --> 11:07.559
N-No, it wasn't us. We didn't do anything.

11:07.560 --> 11:09.270
R-Really.

11:21.210 --> 11:23.309
What is it? Visiting?

11:23.310 --> 11:25.910
N-No, it's nothing. Excuse me.

11:57.580 --> 11:58.580
Here.

12:10.260 --> 12:12.290
Tower goes boom!

12:14.100 --> 12:15.729
It's so fun, meow!

12:15.730 --> 12:18.670
Next is here, then here, then here. There!

12:21.510 --> 12:23.719
Temple goes boom!

12:23.720 --> 12:25.739
Bridge goes boom!

12:25.740 --> 12:27.810
Mountain goes boom!

12:28.710 --> 12:30.810
Take that and that and that!

12:32.410 --> 12:34.810
First, take a look at this.

12:39.490 --> 12:42.689
The Solar and Lunar
Priestesses' uniforms...

12:42.690 --> 12:44.920
passed down the Oogami-kun
family for generations.

12:45.930 --> 12:49.459
This red one is for the Solar Priestess.

12:49.460 --> 12:52.450
The purple one is for the Lunar Priestess.

12:53.230 --> 12:56.580
They enhance the power you
have as priestesses...

12:57.920 --> 13:01.800
and give needed skills to revive
the god of swordsmen, Ame no Murakumo.

13:03.840 --> 13:05.509
How strange.

13:05.510 --> 13:06.180
What is?

13:06.510 --> 13:10.929
It's my first time wearing this
outfit, but it suits me well.

13:10.930 --> 13:14.319
It feels very nostalgic and
makes me happy somehow.

13:14.320 --> 13:16.190
I feel the same way, Himeko.

13:18.330 --> 13:19.759
It's very fitting.

13:19.760 --> 13:23.399
Oh, no. I don't even compare to you.

13:23.400 --> 13:24.400
Really?

13:24.630 --> 13:27.570
I like your color more...

13:27.940 --> 13:30.499
Say, shall we switch once?

13:30.500 --> 13:32.069
W-We can't.

13:32.070 --> 13:35.410
If we do that, God will probably get upset.

13:35.690 --> 13:36.510
You think?

13:36.511 --> 13:37.649
Yes.

13:37.650 --> 13:38.650
Too bad.

13:41.320 --> 13:42.920
Let's do our best, Chikane-chan.

13:44.920 --> 13:45.990
Yes.

14:12.580 --> 14:15.110
This is amazing, Chikane-chan.

14:17.710 --> 14:20.189
You must first use your powers...

14:20.190 --> 14:23.720
to break the seal on
the Six Holy Swords.

14:33.670 --> 14:36.199
Amazing. In one kick.

14:36.200 --> 14:37.390
Yukihito-san.

14:37.910 --> 14:40.900
It feels like power is
emerging from deep inside me.

14:41.340 --> 14:43.879
Making me faster and stronger.

14:43.880 --> 14:45.920
It's like a Superman effect.

14:46.550 --> 14:47.749
Wow.

14:47.750 --> 14:50.450
You're a living superhero character.

14:50.700 --> 14:54.219
Although I'm only good at breaking things.

14:54.220 --> 14:55.659
Oh, no.

14:55.660 --> 14:57.410
That's not what I meant.

14:57.690 --> 15:00.500
Besides, there's more to do. This isn't...

15:06.170 --> 15:07.760
Souma-san, what's wrong?

15:08.540 --> 15:09.599
I'm fine.

15:09.600 --> 15:11.049
This happens often.

15:11.050 --> 15:12.409
B-But...

15:12.410 --> 15:15.009
Oh, I'll go get Oogami-sensei.

15:15.010 --> 15:16.010
Don't!

15:16.410 --> 15:20.570
Please keep it from my brother
and those two, no matter what.

15:21.780 --> 15:23.510
We're all fighting.

15:23.920 --> 15:28.400
I can't be the only one giving up.

15:29.160 --> 15:31.410
I can't afford to lose.

15:34.530 --> 15:37.259
Brave, mighty Susanou no Mikoto.

15:37.260 --> 15:41.000
The country of Izumo falls
on the river of sunlight.

15:44.910 --> 15:49.820
The land's eight-headed dragons
diminish on the Totsuka Sword's blade.

15:53.050 --> 15:56.619
God of Takemi Katana.
God of Iwatsutsu no O.

15:56.620 --> 16:00.119
God of Kanayama Hiko. God of Kanayama Hime.

16:00.120 --> 16:02.440
Along with the powers of
the eight million gods.

16:15.940 --> 16:16.940
No!

16:26.610 --> 16:27.630
Chikane-chan!

16:31.140 --> 16:32.149
I'm sorry.

16:32.150 --> 16:33.260
It was my fault.

16:33.790 --> 16:36.059
Don't say that, Himeko.

16:36.060 --> 16:38.280
No one said it's your fault.

16:42.830 --> 16:45.770
The wound is not as bad as it looks.

16:46.300 --> 16:51.709
It's not that deep, and since it's a
clean cut, it'll heal soon. So...

16:51.710 --> 16:52.850
But...

16:53.270 --> 16:55.239
it is my fault.

16:55.240 --> 16:56.780
No, it's not, Himeko.

16:57.180 --> 16:59.620
It's what we both did.

17:00.780 --> 17:03.150
It can't be your fault.

17:03.650 --> 17:06.550
It's because I couldn't perform my role.

17:07.050 --> 17:09.450
Shall we go see the ocean?

17:10.720 --> 17:13.450
I love the ocean here.

17:14.630 --> 17:17.690
The dark gray seems to swallow everything.

17:17.930 --> 17:21.360
Looking at that endlessly
deep sea relaxes me.

17:22.000 --> 17:26.409
It's a little cold, but there are no
distractions, so let's have a talk.

17:26.410 --> 17:27.410
Okay?

17:31.360 --> 17:34.479
My father and mother who
gave birth to me...

17:34.480 --> 17:37.379
Oogami-kun, Mako-chan, and Chikane-chan...

17:37.380 --> 17:41.940
To me, you're all important
people whom I love very much.

17:42.790 --> 17:46.959
I felt I needed to be reliable for
those people and did my best...

17:46.960 --> 17:50.180
yet I'm the one who's
always hurting everyone.

17:50.500 --> 17:51.920
Even today...

17:53.170 --> 17:57.969
Chikane-chan, am I a bother to everyone?

17:57.970 --> 18:01.270
I guess I shouldn't be near anyone.

18:02.840 --> 18:05.279
Do you know the shell matching game?

18:05.280 --> 18:06.310
Shell matching?

18:06.750 --> 18:09.260
It's like the basis of
the karuta card game.

18:09.620 --> 18:13.530
A game that matches two halves
of a poem written on bivalves.

18:15.020 --> 18:19.960
For bivalves, there's only one set
of valves that match perfectly.

18:20.190 --> 18:21.780
One set in the world.

18:22.100 --> 18:24.729
But there definitely is a set.

18:24.730 --> 18:28.099
I think humans are the same, too.

18:28.100 --> 18:28.750
Humans, too?

18:29.100 --> 18:30.539
There's one for you.

18:30.540 --> 18:33.800
Someone in the world waiting just for you.

18:34.580 --> 18:38.190
Just that one person... for sure.

18:40.030 --> 18:43.049
There isn't a person who has to be alone.

18:43.050 --> 18:46.349
You should just do your
best at your own pace...

18:46.350 --> 18:49.650
until you meet that one and only person.

18:50.520 --> 18:52.220
Until then, I...

18:52.530 --> 18:54.360
I'll protect you.

18:55.700 --> 18:58.360
Thank you, Chikane-chan.

19:03.680 --> 19:05.440
Meow!

19:06.910 --> 19:09.039
Found you, priestesses!

19:09.040 --> 19:10.539
Just wait.

19:10.540 --> 19:12.080
I'll be right there!

19:15.500 --> 19:16.880
Go, Meow-Meow!

19:17.140 --> 19:18.650
There!

19:19.520 --> 19:20.930
Meow!

19:31.500 --> 19:32.600
Himeko.

19:34.370 --> 19:37.070
I... I'll protect you, Himeko.

19:46.010 --> 19:47.459
You're weird.

19:47.460 --> 19:48.719
So funny.

19:48.720 --> 19:51.620
Meow-Meow, I'll wrap things up.

19:56.290 --> 19:58.300
Priestesses go boom!

20:06.350 --> 20:07.850
Meow...

20:14.840 --> 20:16.179
How mean!

20:16.180 --> 20:18.649
Why'd you get in Meow-Meow's way?

20:18.650 --> 20:20.870
I won't forgive you, meow!

20:21.780 --> 20:26.449
Shut up, minion of Orochi. Go
back to hell where you belong!

20:26.450 --> 20:30.620
No way. Nekoko knows you
can't use your hands now.

20:31.060 --> 20:32.870
I'm not scared of you.

20:40.590 --> 20:43.130
Why aren't they hitting you?

20:44.000 --> 20:45.830
Shimmering Solar...

20:49.720 --> 20:52.850
Flying Cannon Kick!

20:57.980 --> 21:00.510
Meow!

21:12.570 --> 21:13.570
Himeko.

21:23.340 --> 21:25.410
I'll protect you.

21:27.650 --> 21:30.600
I shouldn't have ever let her go.

21:42.900 --> 21:45.399
Meow-Meow broke! Stupid Seventh Neck!

21:45.400 --> 21:47.329
But it's surprising...

21:47.330 --> 21:51.239
that the Seventh Neck alone
defeated three Orochi members.

21:51.240 --> 21:52.910
At this rate...

21:56.550 --> 21:58.549
F-First Neck...

21:58.550 --> 22:00.440
Tsubasa-sama...

22:10.050 --> 22:11.810
- Itsuka mita yume
- A dream that was once saw

22:11.813 --> 22:13.810
- Todokanai tsubuyaki dake
- Just a murmur that does not get through

22:13.813 --> 22:15.625
Yoru no hikari ni tsutsumarete samayoi yuku

22:15.626 --> 22:17.439
Wandering while wrapped up in night's light

22:17.440 --> 22:21.020
- Yagate mihiraku sono hitomi Unmei nara - If it
is fate, those eyes will be opened before long

22:21.023 --> 22:22.545
Semete Sou ima dake

22:22.546 --> 22:24.069
At least... yes, only now

22:24.070 --> 22:26.440
- Kanawanai to utsumuku - Looking
downward as the wish does not come true

22:26.443 --> 22:28.410
- Yokaze ni tada unadare
- Merely hanging my head in the night wind

22:28.413 --> 22:32.120
- Namida Tsukikage Te no hira ni afurete yuku - Tears
and moonlight continue to overflow from my palm

22:32.123 --> 22:33.700
- Nani ga hoshii no
- What do you want?

22:33.703 --> 22:35.910
Kuchibiru wa yami ni furuete ita

22:35.911 --> 22:38.119
My lips shivered in the darkness

22:38.120 --> 22:40.455
Deatta ano toki ni mune tsuita egao

22:40.456 --> 22:42.789
The smiling face that pierced
my chest when we came across

22:42.790 --> 22:45.735
Mamoritakute Zutto kuzuresou na yakusoku o

22:45.736 --> 22:48.679
I want to protect it, the promise
that always looks about to collapse

22:48.680 --> 22:50.720
Itami tsubusu hodo ni dakishimeteta

22:50.721 --> 22:52.760
I embraced it while crushing the pain

22:53.600 --> 22:55.015
Soba ni ireru dake de

22:55.016 --> 22:56.429
Just by being by my side

22:56.430 --> 22:58.245
Onaji jikan ni irareru dake de

22:58.246 --> 23:00.059
Just by remaining in the same time as me

23:00.060 --> 23:03.525
Tooi kioku Yomigaeru kanashimi
mo atatamete yukeru no ni

23:03.526 --> 23:06.989
The distant memory and
revived sadness can warmed

23:06.990 --> 23:08.970
Mawaritsuzukete iru omoi ni

23:08.971 --> 23:10.949
In the feelings that continue to circulate

23:10.950 --> 23:12.765
Yasuragi michita owari wa kuru no

23:12.766 --> 23:14.579
Will a peaceful ending come?

23:14.580 --> 23:16.390
Kurikaeshita toikake wa ten ni mai

23:16.391 --> 23:18.199
The repeated question dance in heavens

23:18.200 --> 23:23.730
Ake no sora no Hikari ni kawaru

23:23.731 --> 23:29.260
And turns into the light of the morning sky

23:40.060 --> 23:41.060
Next Time

23:40.680 --> 23:42.419
A rare day off.

23:42.420 --> 23:45.320
I was asked out to an
amusement park by Oogami-kun.

23:45.880 --> 23:50.419
As priestess duties and feelings
toward a childhood friend confuse me...

23:50.420 --> 23:54.320
Chikane-chan encourages
me and kindly sends me off.

23:54.600 --> 23:59.070
But hidden behind her
smile, the truth was...

23:59.080 --> 24:06.080
Direction of Affection

23:59.400 --> 24:01.329
The truth was...

24:01.330 --> 24:04.439
Next time on Kannazuki no Miko, episode 4.

24:04.440 --> 24:06.089
Direction of Affection.

24:06.090 --> 24:09.399
Chikane-chan, what am I supposed to do?
